As a[ parent] of three and a former camper, camp counselor, and camp director, I cannot[ impress] upon[ parents] enough the meaningful impact summer[ camp] can have on children[. In] my parent[ education] classes, I often refer to sleepaway camp as the single most important and[ impact]ful experience a parent can provide their child[.] For most children, sleepaway camp develops the skills and mindsets parents so earnestly want to impart upon their children and does so[ in] ways that we[ parents are sometimes] unable to do[.] So why am[ I] such a passionate[ advocate] for sleepaway camp?[
